# Copy to .env and fill in the same values the Railway service had
# (Railway -> backend -> Variables). Never commit the filled-in .env.

# Public address. setup.sh fills these in; with no domain of your own,
# <ip-with-dashes>.sslip.io resolves to the VPS so Caddy can still get a cert.
